        {
          "text": "Ha kiro ekya ikumi na bitaano eby'okwezi kwa musanju, naha biro musanju eby'obugenyi, nabwo aleete ebintu nka biri ebi yaleesire okubanza, eby'ekihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi, ebihongwa eby'okwokya, eby'ebyokulya n'amagita.",
